+### Toolchain-neutral adapter rule
+
+The framework adapter must consume the application's toolchain rather than bring its own. In particular, canonical adapter source must not pin the consumer's Gradle, Android Gradle Plugin, Kotlin plugin, JDK, CocoaPods, or Xcode version merely